cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Scraping Eagle, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Scraping Eagle"
abstract: >-
  Scraping Eagle is an open-source web scraping CLI and Claude Code skill. One command, `scrape URL`,
  fetches any web page, escalates automatically from a fast HTTP request to a stealth browser when a
  site blocks bots, and returns clean Markdown, JSON or CSV for AI agents and developers.
